      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yeah, it was okay! I just had a couple of weird days. I wasn't feeling my best today.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-08T12:43:28.520874+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh my, I didn't know you were having a rough time. Can I do anything to help out?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-08T12:43:57.500836+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yeah, I wasn't feeling my best today. Is there anything else you want to talk about?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-08T12:44:52.855473+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I'm sorry to hear that. Have you had a good day?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-08T12:45:24.896367+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Yeah, it was okay. It's just been a couple of days and I've been feeling off.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-08T12:46:25.846831+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I understand. Have you been talking to someone else?",
